# Local configuration, which `deployments/local/env/local.example.env` tells you to create here.
# The template promises the copy is ignored; this is the rule that keeps the promise.
deployments/local/env/local.env

# Claude Code's per-developer state, now that `.claude/` holds something the project owns.
# `settings.local.json` is a permission allowlist — one machine's answer, and one that grants
# elevated privileges, so it is never the project's. `worktrees/` is scratch checkouts.
# `.claude/skills/` is tracked: the procedures it wraps are in `docs/agents/` and belong to everyone.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
